<h1>Teen Driving Safety for Parents: What You Actually Need to Know</h1>
<p class="dek">Your state tells you when your kid can drive. It doesn’t tell you when they’re ready. Here’s the part nobody hands you.</p>
<div class="meta"><span class="by">By <a href="/about/#founder">Robert Abbott</a></span><span>·</span><span>Founder, DRVN</span><span>·</span><span>Last reviewed October 2026</span><span>·</span><span>14 min read</span></div>
</div>
